     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How gustar works",
     "texto": [
      "The verb **gustar** works differently from English: the liked thing is the grammatical subject, and the person liking it is an indirect object pronoun (**me**, **te**, **le**, **nos**, **os**, **les**).\n\n- With a singular noun or an infinitive, use **gusta**: *Me gusta el café*, *Te gusta leer*.\n- With a plural noun, use **gustan**: *Me gustan los libros*.\n\nFor emphasis, you can add **a mí**, **a ti**, etc.: *A mí me gusta el café*."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
